19
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:40,460
NATSUKI: Jeez, would you guys calm down? 
It's already hot as is!

20
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,320
KEITO: You're all so full of energy.

21
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:45,580
KEITO: And so, it's begun. Ready, and...

22
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:48,330
ALL: F/ACE's Super Exciting Summer Vacation!

23
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:50,400
ALL: Yay!

24
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:55,170
ARIMOTO: Wow, you're all so unique. 
Maybe you guys don't even need a script.

25
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:56,880
