312
00:09:06,620 --> 00:09:09,710
UTAGE: Oh... Thank you very much...

313
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:14,390
OURI: Seriously...

314
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:17,900
OURI: Why's it gotta be him and not me?

315
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:22,720
UTAGE: By "him, " do you mean Tamon-kun?

316
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:25,080
OURI: Huh?! U-Uh, I...

317
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:27,430
UTAGE: I'm not sure how to respond.

318
00:09:27,430 --> 00:09:31,240
UTAGE: My feelings for Tamon-kun are just 
so great that it's hard to explain, 

319
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:34,880
UTAGE: so can I just read these sutras
 I compiled over the last two years?

320
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:35,860
OURI: What the hell is that?!

321
00:09:35,860 --> 00:09:38,110
OURI: I don't even want to hear 
a sentence of that!

322
00:09:39,530 --> 00:09:41,070
OURI: If you're done here, 
then get the hell out!

323
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,460
OURI: You big dummy!

324
00:09:46,490 --> 00:09:49,510
UTAGE: I can't believe he called me 
over just for this.

325
00:09:54,910 --> 00:09:56,170
