331
00:09:58,070 --> 00:09:59,920
UTAGE: Why do you have that on your face?

332
00:10:00,250 --> 00:10:03,750
TAMON: I dislike having to bathe with 
other people, so I'm exhausted...

333
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:08,370
UTAGE: Yet you can barely keep your clothes on 
when you're Hottiehara-kun.

334
00:10:11,710 --> 00:10:14,390
UTAGE: Oh, sorry you have to see me like this.

335
00:10:14,650 --> 00:10:17,480
UTAGE: I forgot my fan and 
Sakaguchi-san summoned me.

336
00:10:17,890 --> 00:10:19,510
TAMON: Ouri-kun did?

337
00:10:19,510 --> 00:10:20,730
UTAGE/INT: Is that Darkhara-san?!

338
00:10:20,730 --> 00:10:22,640
UTAGE: I just went to get my fan!

339
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:24,860
TAMON: Er, no, I mean...

340
00:10:25,170 --> 00:10:26,680
TAMON: Were you okay?

341
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:27,530
UTAGE: I'm sorry?

342
00:10:27,530 --> 00:10:30,160
TAMON: I asked if you'd come along...

343
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:33,420
TAMON: Thinking back on it now, 
it was really annoying of me to ask.

344
00:10:33,420 --> 00:10:36,170
TAMON: I'm sorry that 
I was only thinking of myself.

345
00:10:36,170 --> 00:10:37,130
UTAGE: What?

346
00:10:37,130 --> 00:10:39,540
TAMON: I know this work is new to you. 
Have you been doing okay?

347
00:10:39,540 --> 00:10:42,330
TAMON: Has Ouri-kun been impossible
 to deal with at all?

348
00:10:42,330 --> 00:10:44,720
TAMON: Has Keito-kun been mean again?

349
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,470
UTAGE: Oh, I'm totally fine!

350
00:10:47,470 --> 00:10:50,820
UTAGE: You just need to worry 
about yourself, Gloomyhara-san!

351
00:10:50,820 --> 00:10:53,830
UTAGE: That's why I came along 
as your housekeeper.

352
00:10:53,830 --> 00:10:54,660
UTAGE: Farewell!

